bughint- gathers some information for bug reporting. Shipped in the
	tarball but not installed.

convertfonts- converts XLFD font names in a style file to fontconfig
	format.

geticonset- outputs the current set of icon assignments. Good for making
	themes.

getstyle - gets current style settings and save into a file or create
	a theme pack.

seticons- merges icon definitions into WMWindowAttributes file

setstyle- load style settings from a style file and setup WindowMaker

wdread- read simple data from defaults database (for use in scripts for
	example)

wdwrite- write data into the defaults database (configuration files).

wkdemenu.pl- convert a KDE menu into a wmaker menu (for pipe)

wm-oldmenu2new - converts between the plain text file menu format to the
	property list menu format.

wmagnify- a program to magnify the area near the mouse pointer,
	with real-time update

wmaker.inst- quick and dirty script to install necessary files from
	global configuration to user's directory. Look in the script to
	adapt it to your site.

wmakermsg- send commands to and receive events from a running Window
	Maker over its Unix-socket IPC.

wmclipd- X11 clipboard daemon, can also subscribe to Window Maker screenshot
	IPC events and publish saved screenshots to CLIPBOARD

wmgenmenu- generate a Window Maker root menu by probing for installed
	applications.

wmglyph- lightweight Unicode glyph selector. Click a character to copy it
	to the X selection (PRIMARY and CLIPBOARD).

wmiv- quick image viewer using wrlib

wmlock- X11 screen locker for Window Maker, authenticates via PAM or
	bsd_auth.

wmmenugen- generate a Window Maker proplist root menu from XDG .desktop
	files or wmconfig entries.

wmsetbg- set the workspace background to an image and make it persist
	between sessions.

wxcopy- copy input file or stdin into X cutbuffer

wxpaste- copy content of X cutbuffer into stdout
